error[SCXML071]: an `<invoke>` with `<param>` children cannot also use `namelist`
 --> tests/ui/scxml071-invoke-namelist-with-param.scx:6:13
  |
6 |     <invoke namelist="x">
  |             ^^^^^^^^^^^^ namelist conflicts with the param children
7 |       <param name="y" expr="2"/>
  |        ----- param declared here
  |
  = note: `namelist` and `<param>` both pass data to the invoked service; SCXML allows only one of them on an `<invoke>`
  = help: pass each namelist location as a `<param>` with a `location`
  = spec: SCXML 1.0 §6.4 <invoke>
help: pass the namelist locations as `<param>` children
  |
6 -     <invoke namelist="x">
6 +     <invoke><param name="x" location="x"/>

